{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7e2c1a0-neocom-back-adapters-001",
    "name": "NEOCOM Back",
    "description": "Single collection for every inbound HTTP adapter under `src/infrastructure/adapters/inbound/`.\n\nEach adapter folder has **Happy path** then **Exceptions** (documented OpenAPI / ExceptionCatalog outcomes).\n\n**OpenAPI** (`tools/openapi/`):\n- `auth-service-v0.1.0.yaml`\n- `pilot-service-v0.1.0.yaml`\n- `industry-service-v0.1.0.yaml`\n- `manufacture-service-v0.1.0.yaml`\n- `universe-service-v0.1.0.yaml`\n\n**Auth outside Postman:** log in via neocom-front, then run **Auth \u2192 Happy path \u2192 Load session from back**.\n\nEnvironment: **NEOCOM local**.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
